    "What dependency would you like to add?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你想添加哪个依赖项？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is a Workgroup?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "什么是工作组？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When set, the trigger fires only for the workgroup leader (the session that originally entered the workgroup). Peers such as the Code Review and Diff sessions do not, so reloading or quitting one keeps the workgroup open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置后，触发器仅在工作组主导者（最初进入工作组的会话）上触发。代码审查和差异等对等会话不会触发，因此重新载入或退出其中一个会话不会关闭工作组。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Workgroup name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作组名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can use captured strings from the Smart Selection's regular expression in the parameter. Use \\\\0 for match, \\\\1…\\\\9 for match groups, \\\\d for directory, \\\\u for user, \\\\h for host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可以在参数中使用智能选择正则表达式捕获的字符串。使用 \\\\0 表示匹配项，\\\\1…\\\\9 表示匹配组，\\\\d 表示目录，\\\\u 表示用户，\\\\h 表示主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have asked to downgrade to an older Python version. Dependencies will need to be reinstalled. This may go badly. Are you sure you want to do this?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已请求降级到较旧的 Python 版本。依赖项需要重新安装。这可能不太顺利。确定要这样做吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have asked to upgrade to a newer Python version. Dependencies will need to be reinstalled. OK to continue?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已请求升级到较新的 Python 版本。依赖项需要重新安装。继续吗？"
